Kid, shh.

00:35:34.880 --> 00:35:35.210
Xiaoshan.

00:35:35.280 --> 00:35:36.340
Xi.

00:35:36.590 --> 00:35:36.980
Xiaoshan.

00:35:37.280 --> 00:35:38.900
Give me back my sister!

00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:39.820
Calm down.

00:35:39.840 --> 00:35:40.820
Xi.

00:35:41.400 --> 00:35:41.900
Calm down.

